Require target/release/ttd

Output docs/screenshots/tui-editor.gif
Set Width 960
Set Height 540
Set FontSize 16

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "./target/release/ttd --task-dir demo-data/todo.txt.d"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Type "a"
Sleep 300ms
Type "Buy more coffee +Personal @phone due:"
Ctrl+d
Sleep 1s

Escape
Sleep 300ms

Type "q"
Sleep 200ms
